{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24353","headline":"雪中酒熟欲携访吴监先寄此诗 · 白居易","name":"雪中酒熟欲携访吴监先寄此诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新雪对新酒，忆同倾一杯。\n自然须访戴，不必待延枚。\n陈榻无辞解，袁门莫嬾开。\n笙歌与谈笑，随事自将来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}